      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Since 1963, Prestwould Plantation has operated as a house museum, preserving 11 structures—including an 1780s slave house and family cemetery—that document life with over 200 enslaved people.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
