      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Skipwith sits in Virginia’s Piedmont, where humid subtropical weather brings about 42.7 inches of rain annually and roughly 3.5 inches of snow each winter.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        18,
