      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Skipwith is an unincorporated community in Mecklenburg County’s former Bluestone Township, positioned between Chase City and Clarksville, just west‑northwest of Boydton.",
